{"4519130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MOLDRISE", "steam_appid": 4519130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It started in your foot. Now it’s in your head.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thought left is: <strong>GO UP</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building has thirty floors. Your body has problems - hunger, thirst, exhaustion. The infection doesn’t care. It only wants altitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your body is in shambles... but the foot keeps climbing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet your Neighbors.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is not haunted. The people in it are not monsters - and they want things. Junk. Food. Favors. Someone to do something mildly humiliating to their neighbor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A few of them know things they shouldn't. And maybe what they know has something in common.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the only one collecting the pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn. Adapt. Climb.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>building is the same every time</strong> <strong>you climb it</strong>. The neighbors are the same. The trades are the same. The vending machine on the ground floor has the same stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What changes is what you know.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, you learn something. A shortcut. A better trade. An item you thought was useless until it saved your life. Slowly, the building starts to make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And again and again and again and again and again.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll know what to do next time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But your foot isn’t waiting.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack by Mike Klubnika.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOLDRISE features a full-length original soundtrack, composed by Mike Klubnika, creator of Buckshot Roulette, s.p.l.i.t., and Machine Party.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>First-person survival horror. Retro aesthetics. A thirty-floor apartment building with no empty floors and no happy endings.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It started in your foot. Now it’s in your head.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thought left is: <strong>GO UP</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building has thirty floors. Your body has problems - hunger, thirst, exhaustion. The infection doesn’t care. It only wants altitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your body is in shambles... but the foot keeps climbing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/ce1a6dbff8ca188aec572e4a06a3d6d9.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet your Neighbors.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is not haunted. The people in it are not monsters - and they want things. Junk. Food. Favors. Someone to do something mildly humiliating to their neighbor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A few of them know things they shouldn't. And maybe what they know has something in common.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the only one collecting the pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/6c2491aaa2b0363203a02195f519457f.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn. Adapt. Climb.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>building is the same every time</strong> <strong>you climb it</strong>. The neighbors are the same. The trades are the same. The vending machine on the ground floor has the same stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What changes is what you know.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, you learn something. A shortcut. A better trade. An item you thought was useless until it saved your life. Slowly, the building starts to make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.poster.avif?t=1788210620\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.webm?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/extras/7cdea5559cb4910918686509935df709.mp4?t=1788210620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And again and again and again and again and again.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll know what to do next time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But your foot isn’t waiting.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack by Mike Klubnika.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOLDRISE features a full-length original soundtrack, composed by Mike Klubnika, creator of Buckshot Roulette, s.p.l.i.t., and Machine Party.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>First-person survival horror. Retro aesthetics. A thirty-floor apartment building with no empty floors and no happy endings.</i></p>", "short_description": "It started in your foot. Now it’s in your head. All that remains is the command: GO UP. Meet strange neighbors. Make bad trades. Every ascent teaches you what you should have done differently.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Damn! That's a really good game! I enjoyed that immensely!”<br>jacksepticeye<br><br>“The gameplay, the aesthetics, the musics - incredible job.”<br>Hollow<br><br>“This game is so sick! It's really cool!”<br>Insym<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/1e86fd32896317d1e4fdae7540a3e953cff0feaa/header.jpg?t=1788210620", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/db567ccef04738a1187be11d60f7e6dfeb7206a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788210620", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519130/db567ccef04738a1187be11d60f7e6dfeb7206a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788210620", "website": "https://www.moldrise.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 950 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul 